WEBVTT

01:36.905 --> 01:39.805
[Episode 6]

01:40.406 --> 01:42.220
He saved me.

01:42.864 --> 01:43.873
I thought

01:43.873 --> 01:45.707
he only wanted a test of skill.

01:45.707 --> 01:48.440
So I didn't see the need to expose him.

01:48.440 --> 01:51.106
I didn't expect him to steal the official seal.

01:51.106 --> 01:53.773
He lost his nerve. Right at the end.

01:53.773 --> 01:55.173
He thought he couldn't defeat you,

01:55.173 --> 01:57.206
so he ran away in a hurry.

01:57.206 --> 01:59.006
Let's go to Xiankong Island.

01:59.006 --> 02:01.806
Now? It's like walking into a trap.

02:01.806 --> 02:03.273
That's those rats' nest.

02:03.273 --> 02:04.906
He has so many brothers there.

02:04.906 --> 02:08.006
Maybe, this is their idea to trick you there.

02:08.006 --> 02:11.173
If word gets out that Lord Bao's official seal
is lost,

02:11.173 --> 02:14.006
certain will seize the chance to make trouble.

02:14.006 --> 02:16.006
Even if I'm walking into a trap,

02:16.006 --> 02:18.361
I must go there.

02:21.039 --> 02:22.940
This place is really nice.

02:22.940 --> 02:24.573
The water is clearer,

02:24.573 --> 02:26.673
and the breeze is gentle.

02:26.673 --> 02:29.406
My Lord, are we almost at Xiankong Island?

02:29.406 --> 02:31.440
Yes.

02:31.440 --> 02:33.840
Ahead of us is a field of reeds.

02:33.840 --> 02:35.273
Xiankong Island is to the south.

02:35.273 --> 02:38.273
Are you really going to Xiankong Island?

02:38.273 --> 02:39.440
Yes.

02:39.440 --> 02:41.073
I hear the island has fine views.

02:41.073 --> 02:42.840
I want to take a look.

02:42.840 --> 02:44.706
Don't do that.

02:44.706 --> 02:46.039
On Xiankong Island,

02:46.039 --> 02:47.873
there's the Five Rats' private estate.

02:47.873 --> 02:50.806
Not a pleasure garden for idle sightseers.

02:50.806 --> 02:52.806
The Five Rats?

02:52.806 --> 02:55.706
Are they also known as the Five Justices?

02:55.706 --> 02:56.973
Their leader

02:56.973 --> 02:58.873
is Lu Fang, known as Zuantian Rat.

02:58.873 --> 03:01.620
Exactly true.

03:01.620 --> 03:03.973
People say the Five Justices are chivalrous

03:03.973 --> 03:05.906
and love to make friends.

03:05.906 --> 03:08.406
I doubt they'd refuse us a visit.

03:08.406 --> 03:09.506
Usually,

03:09.506 --> 03:12.000
if you talk to them nicely, it might work.

03:12.000 --> 03:13.840
But it definitely won't work these days.

03:13.840 --> 03:15.173
A few days ago,

03:15.173 --> 03:17.639
I took a fruit merchant there.

03:17.639 --> 03:19.906
He was kicked out as soon as he landed.

03:19.906 --> 03:21.706
Lately, the docks on Xiankong Island

03:21.706 --> 03:24.023
have been guarded.

03:24.023 --> 03:25.673
No one is allowed to enter.

03:25.673 --> 03:27.306
Maybe

03:27.306 --> 03:28.680
that Jinmao Rat

03:28.680 --> 03:30.273
got into some trouble again

03:30.273 --> 03:33.010
and is hiding on the island.

03:34.306 --> 03:35.773
So,

03:35.773 --> 03:38.073
Bai Yu Tang doesn't seem to be well spoken of.

03:38.073 --> 03:40.573
The first four of the Five Rats

03:40.573 --> 03:42.173
are quite reasonable.

03:42.173 --> 03:43.206
But this one,

03:43.206 --> 03:44.373
Bai Yu Tang the Jinmao Rat,

03:44.373 --> 03:45.953
has a strange personality.

03:45.953 --> 03:48.119
You won't get far reasoning with him.

03:48.119 --> 03:50.003
I heard that not long ago,

03:50.003 --> 03:55.560
a young man was beaten by Bai Yu Tang,
simply for being better looking than him.

03:55.560 --> 03:58.453
While beating him, Bai Yu Tang said,

03:58.453 --> 04:03.053
"If I see you appearing around here again,

04:03.053 --> 04:05.186
I'll ruin your face.

04:05.186 --> 04:07.340
Best stop calling yourself handsome.

04:07.340 --> 04:10.252
All that 'everyone loves me' is just a laugh."

04:10.953 --> 04:13.006
Look at you.

04:13.006 --> 04:14.240
Once you're on the island,

04:14.240 --> 04:16.583
you'll probably get beaten up too.

04:16.583 --> 04:17.873
A rat beating up a cat?

04:17.873 --> 04:20.606
That's a first for me.

04:20.606 --> 04:22.706
There must be some misunderstanding.

04:22.706 --> 04:24.006
Still don't believe me?

04:24.006 --> 04:25.373
I've warned you.

04:25.373 --> 04:27.173
Go ahead if you want.

04:27.173 --> 04:28.406
If

04:28.406 --> 04:31.040
you truly anger Bai Yu Tang,

04:31.040 --> 04:33.406
go to Mohua Village in Songjiang Prefecture.

04:33.406 --> 04:34.450
Seek out Chief Ding.

04:34.450 --> 04:36.373
His family is
on good terms with Xiankong Island.

04:36.373 --> 04:39.810
Perhaps he can put in a good word for you.

04:40.839 --> 04:42.006
In that case,

04:42.006 --> 04:46.020
let's head to the Ding's first.

04:46.020 --> 04:47.652
All right.

05:04.370 --> 05:06.040
I heard you say earlier

05:06.040 --> 05:08.073
that you lived in Songjiang for a while.

05:08.073 --> 05:10.839
Don't tell me you're staying at the Ding's.

05:10.839 --> 05:12.373
That's true.

05:12.373 --> 05:13.639
I learned Heavenward Crane Strike

05:13.639 --> 05:16.073
from Uncle Ding.

05:16.073 --> 05:17.206
So,

05:17.206 --> 05:18.440
the rumors are true?

05:18.440 --> 05:19.839
What rumors?

05:19.839 --> 05:22.206
That you are the Ding family's
recognized son-in-law.

05:22.206 --> 05:26.172
And that's why Ding taught you
Heavenward Crane Strike.

05:29.006 --> 05:31.839
How can you believe such gossip?

05:31.839 --> 05:34.773
Our families have been friends for generations.

05:34.773 --> 05:36.406
Uncle Ding told me that the Zhan family

05:36.406 --> 05:38.206
once did the Ding family a favor.

05:38.206 --> 05:40.306
So he taught me Heavenward Crane Strike

05:40.306 --> 05:43.406
to fulfill his wish of repaying that debt.

05:43.406 --> 05:44.606
That's how it is.

05:44.606 --> 05:46.173
My Lord, don't you worry.

05:46.173 --> 05:49.639
I'll do everything to put this rumor to rest.

05:49.639 --> 05:51.639
Soon you'll be back at the top of the list

05:51.639 --> 05:54.240
ladies in the capital most want to marry.

05:54.240 --> 05:55.506
What list?

05:55.506 --> 05:56.639
Forget it.

05:56.639 --> 05:58.500
But must be careful.

05:58.500 --> 06:00.020
Such romantic rumors

06:00.020 --> 06:01.692
always break a young lady's heart.

06:01.692 --> 06:03.073
It affects your ranking.

06:03.073 --> 06:04.440
Stay away from those rumors.

06:04.440 --> 06:05.673
Just maintain your good image.

06:05.673 --> 06:08.806
After all, being a hero isn't easy.

06:08.806 --> 06:11.006
You know quite a lot about how to be a hero.

06:11.006 --> 06:12.106
Of course.

06:12.106 --> 06:14.429
Take my word for it.

06:21.306 --> 06:23.404
[Ding Zhao Hui, one of the Ding Twins]
Zhan!

06:24.373 --> 06:26.306
What brings you here?

06:26.306 --> 06:28.573
Why didn't you tell us you were coming?

06:28.573 --> 06:30.406
I decided on the spur of the moment.

06:30.406 --> 06:32.420
Are you heading out?

06:32.420 --> 06:36.440
Yes. I heard Shen Zhong Yuan
is holding a gathering at his estate.

06:36.440 --> 06:38.373
Such a big event, I have to see it.

06:38.373 --> 06:40.273
You haven't changed at all.

06:40.273 --> 06:41.373
Ming Zhu Er.

06:41.373 --> 06:43.906
This is Ding Zhao Hui, one of the Ding Twins.

06:43.906 --> 06:45.273
And this is Ming Zhu Er.

06:45.273 --> 06:48.440
So you're the real Ding. The second brother.

06:48.440 --> 06:50.106
The real Ding?

06:50.106 --> 06:51.273
What do you mean?

06:51.273 --> 06:53.673
Is someone pretending to be me?

06:53.673 --> 06:55.373
It's a long story.

06:55.373 --> 06:56.373
Zhao Hui.

06:56.373 --> 06:57.440
I came all this way

06:57.440 --> 07:01.160
to ask the Ding family for help with something.

07:03.449 --> 07:05.706
So that's what happened.

07:05.706 --> 07:07.306
Pretending to be me? That I can forgive.

07:07.306 --> 07:09.606
But taking the seal? How stupid.

07:09.606 --> 07:11.173
When the imperial court investigates,

07:11.173 --> 07:12.806
the Five Rats will share the blame.

07:12.806 --> 07:14.206
I have long heard of

07:14.206 --> 07:15.680
the Five Justices of Xiankong Island.

07:15.680 --> 07:16.750
I respect them greatly.

07:16.750 --> 07:19.106
Though I haven't known Bai Yu Tang for long,

07:19.106 --> 07:21.506
I know he is a chivalrous man.

07:21.506 --> 07:23.773
That's why I'd rather not let this escalate.

07:23.773 --> 07:25.706
I only wish to persuade him

07:25.706 --> 07:27.106
to return the official seal

07:27.106 --> 07:28.373
and explain to Lord Bao.

07:28.373 --> 07:30.440
Then the matter can be settled.

07:30.440 --> 07:33.173
My Lord, isn't that letting him off too easily?

07:33.173 --> 07:34.980
The boatman said earlier

07:34.980 --> 07:38.040
that he hits people just because
he's jealous of their looks.

07:38.040 --> 07:41.440
Look, he even kicked me for no reason.

07:41.440 --> 07:44.106
What kind of chivalrous man is he?

07:44.106 --> 07:45.906
Don't believe those rumors.

07:45.906 --> 07:49.440
Bai Yu Tang beat up Hua Chong,
nicknamed "Flower Butterfly".

07:49.440 --> 07:51.440
That man harassed the Guo family's daughter.

07:51.440 --> 07:53.673
Bai Yu Tang only acted to right a wrong.

07:53.673 --> 07:54.920
He just didn't expect

07:54.920 --> 07:56.696
that Hua Chong refused to admit fault.

07:56.696 --> 07:57.960
He distorted the truth

07:57.960 --> 07:59.273
and slandered Bai Yu Tang.

07:59.273 --> 08:00.306
The Guo family

08:00.306 --> 08:03.173
feared gossip about the girl.

08:03.173 --> 08:08.306
So they didn't clarify anything.
The rumors twisted and grew worse with telling.

08:08.306 --> 08:09.573
I see.

08:09.573 --> 08:10.573
Zhan.

08:10.573 --> 08:13.000
You said you needed help from the Ding family.

08:13.000 --> 08:14.706
Do you mean going to Xiankong Island?

08:14.706 --> 08:15.973
Exactly.

08:15.973 --> 08:18.839
I heard that the island has been closed.

08:18.839 --> 08:19.906
No visitors are allowed.

08:19.906 --> 08:21.040
I have just arrived.

08:21.040 --> 08:23.240
I'm afraid it wouldn't be proper
to barge onto the island.

08:23.240 --> 08:25.525
So I'd like to ask the Ding family

08:25.525 --> 08:27.479
to handle this for me.

08:34.839 --> 08:36.640
No need to put yourself out if it's hard.

08:36.640 --> 08:37.640
No, no, no.

08:37.640 --> 08:39.973
Zhan, the Ding family will definitely help you.

08:39.973 --> 08:41.773
Why don't we go there right now?

08:41.773 --> 08:43.552
Zhao Hui.

08:45.006 --> 08:46.406
It's getting a bit late

08:46.406 --> 08:47.473
to be setting out for the island now.

08:47.473 --> 08:49.206
How about this? Keep your things.

08:49.206 --> 08:51.239
I'll go check on Zhao Lan and Yue Hua.

08:51.239 --> 08:54.440
That sounds better.

08:54.440 --> 08:57.173
Ding Zhao Hui didn't seem the least bit angry,

08:57.173 --> 08:58.973
not even after that white rat stole his name.

08:58.973 --> 09:01.106
Instead, he helped clean up the mess.

09:01.106 --> 09:02.273
It seems

09:02.273 --> 09:04.206
they have a good relationship.

09:04.206 --> 09:06.506
Those two must share the same nature.

09:06.506 --> 09:08.606
Both martial arts fanatics.

09:08.606 --> 09:10.239
Bai Yu Tang went to the capital

09:10.239 --> 09:12.873
and stole the official seal,
just to test his skill against mine.

09:12.873 --> 09:14.106
When Zhao Hui was young,

09:14.106 --> 09:16.673
to compete with Yue Hua over
who could learn Heavenward Crane Strike,

09:16.673 --> 09:18.240
he locked himself in his room

09:18.240 --> 09:19.406
and didn't eat for three days

09:19.406 --> 09:20.873
just to learn the mental techniques.

09:20.873 --> 09:23.673
So, who won? He or Lady Ding?

09:23.673 --> 09:25.440
The hardest part of Heavenward Crane Strike

09:25.440 --> 09:27.506
is the circulation of inner energy.

09:27.506 --> 09:29.640
The more impatient you are, the harder it is.

09:29.640 --> 09:30.960
But Zhao Hui and Yue Hua

09:30.960 --> 09:32.720
are both impatient.

09:32.720 --> 09:34.040
So the one who finally mastered it

09:34.040 --> 09:36.006
was actually Zhao Lan, their eldest brother,

09:36.006 --> 09:38.473
who is calm-minded.

09:38.473 --> 09:40.506
I heard from the storytellers in Bianjing city

09:40.506 --> 09:41.973
that the Ding Twins

09:41.973 --> 09:43.273
look exactly alike.

09:43.273 --> 09:44.839
My Lord, is that true?

09:44.839 --> 09:46.173
It is indeed.

09:46.173 --> 09:48.640
They are a pair of twins.

09:48.640 --> 09:50.673
The only difference between them is

09:50.673 --> 09:53.474
that Zhao Lan has a mole between his eyebrows.

09:53.474 --> 09:57.791
[The Ding family]

10:01.839 --> 10:03.073
Lord Zhan.

10:03.073 --> 10:05.206
Old Ding, it has been a long time.

10:05.206 --> 10:06.440
How is your health?

10:06.440 --> 10:07.706
All is well, all is well.

10:07.706 --> 10:10.406
Lord Zhan,
it's been a long time since you last came.

10:10.406 --> 10:11.873
Our young master will be delighted

10:11.873 --> 10:14.073
to lay eyes on you.

10:14.073 --> 10:16.373
Please come in.

10:16.373 --> 10:19.903
Look who's here!

10:21.873 --> 10:23.839
Zhan.

10:23.839 --> 10:26.206
Zhan, what brings you here?

10:26.206 --> 10:27.306
For official business around.

10:27.306 --> 10:29.406
I stopped by to see you and Yue Hua.

10:29.406 --> 10:32.073
If you had arrived a bit earlier,
you would have seen Zhao Hui.

10:32.073 --> 10:33.506
He just left not long ago.

10:33.506 --> 10:34.673
I ran into him on the road.

10:34.673 --> 10:37.498
Is that so? What a coincidence.

10:38.973 --> 10:40.206
Where is Yue Hua?

10:40.206 --> 10:43.440
I recall that no one is permitted

10:43.440 --> 10:44.440
to touch these camellias

10:44.440 --> 10:47.029
save for Yue Hua and that little maid.

10:47.651 --> 10:50.306
That little maid went back home for marriage.

10:50.306 --> 10:51.506
Yue Hua has fallen ill,

10:51.506 --> 10:54.040
and can no longer tend to these flowers.

10:54.040 --> 10:55.839
What illness? Is it serious?

10:55.839 --> 10:57.173
Take your time.

10:57.173 --> 11:00.067
Let's get inside and talk it through. This way.

11:01.206 --> 11:03.473
Zhao Lan, what illness does Yue Hua have?

11:03.473 --> 11:04.973
Is it truly not serious?

11:04.973 --> 11:06.006
It's not serious.

11:06.006 --> 11:07.640
Just dizziness and a fever this morning.

11:07.640 --> 11:09.573
She has taken medicine
and is resting in her room now.

11:09.573 --> 11:11.606
It's not serious.

11:11.606 --> 11:13.206
She's grown now.

11:13.206 --> 11:16.040
Her chambers are off limits to men now.

11:16.040 --> 11:17.074
I'm afraid you two

11:17.074 --> 11:19.320
won't be able to meet this time.

11:19.320 --> 11:20.506
By the way,

11:20.506 --> 11:23.506
you mentioned earlier
that you are here on official business.

11:23.506 --> 11:25.373
Is there anything I can help you with?

11:25.373 --> 11:27.806
I had a misunderstanding with Bai Yu Tang.

11:27.806 --> 11:29.673
I want to go to the island to clear things up.

11:29.673 --> 11:30.906
But I heard that Xiankong Island

11:30.906 --> 11:32.806
is closed to outsiders these few days.

11:32.806 --> 11:35.273
It might be unwise for me
to set foot on the island uninvited.

11:35.273 --> 11:36.839
So may you write a letter

11:36.839 --> 11:37.906
to Chief Lu

11:37.906 --> 11:39.273
and explain my purpose for coming?

11:39.273 --> 11:40.873
Easy. Don't worry.

11:40.873 --> 11:43.518
I'll have the letter ready tonight.

11:44.252 --> 11:46.073
Zhao Lan, in a little while,

11:46.073 --> 11:47.773
I'd like to go to Tingfeng Pavilion

11:47.773 --> 11:49.873
to pay my respects to Uncle Ding.

11:49.873 --> 11:50.940
Okay.

11:50.940 --> 11:52.573
Zhan, you go ahead.

11:52.573 --> 11:53.773
I'll go check on the meal.

11:53.773 --> 11:55.206
We haven't had guests for a long time.

11:55.206 --> 11:57.576
They might slip.

11:57.576 --> 12:08.652
[Virtue Casts a Long Light.]

12:29.406 --> 12:32.073
It's decorated with such exquisite taste.

12:32.073 --> 12:34.006
Doesn't feel like a wanderer's den,

12:34.006 --> 12:37.239
but more like a scholar's study.

12:37.239 --> 12:38.673
Besides practicing martial arts,

12:38.673 --> 12:40.006
during his lifetime, Uncle Ding was

12:40.006 --> 12:43.006
also quite knowledgeable
in calligraphy, painting, and chess.

12:43.006 --> 12:44.006
Back then,

12:44.006 --> 12:45.673
he taught us martial arts by day.

12:45.673 --> 12:46.673
And at night,

12:46.673 --> 12:48.306
he would take us to Tingfeng Pavilion

12:48.306 --> 12:50.485
to practice calligraphy and play chess.

12:56.073 --> 12:57.406
I remember Uncle Ding

12:57.406 --> 12:59.606
once told me while we played chess

12:59.606 --> 13:01.006
that blind courage alone

13:01.006 --> 13:02.640
is not enough to master martial arts.

13:02.640 --> 13:04.273
A battle in martial arts

13:04.273 --> 13:06.573
is just like a game on a chessboard.

13:06.573 --> 13:08.873
One must remain objective and steady.

13:08.873 --> 13:10.173
Only then

13:10.173 --> 13:12.206
can you discern your opponent's intent

13:12.206 --> 13:15.354
and know how to counter and defeat them.

13:19.260 --> 13:20.740
At that time,

13:20.740 --> 13:23.846
I didn't understand his meaning.

13:23.846 --> 13:25.913
I only remember that as we played,

13:25.913 --> 13:27.913
the wind blew through the bamboo forest.

13:27.913 --> 13:29.480
The sound

13:29.480 --> 13:32.078
was truly nice.

13:36.680 --> 13:39.480
No wonder it's called Tingfeng Pavilion.

13:39.480 --> 13:41.783
Let me listen to it too.

13:47.046 --> 13:48.346
My Lord,

13:48.346 --> 13:50.746
I can't hear anything at all.

13:50.746 --> 13:53.644
Is it because there's no wind outside?

13:56.046 --> 13:57.313
Lord Zhan,

13:57.313 --> 14:00.277
dinner is ready. Please follow me.

14:16.416 --> 14:17.813
When we were young,

14:17.813 --> 14:20.246
after father taught you
the Heavenward Crane Strike,

14:20.246 --> 14:22.846
my younger brother often teased you about it.

14:22.846 --> 14:24.746
Later, father told us

14:24.746 --> 14:26.046
that the Zhan family

14:26.046 --> 14:27.213
once saved the Ding family.

14:27.213 --> 14:29.446
Teaching you the Heavenward Crane Strike

14:29.446 --> 14:31.313
couldn't repay even a fraction of it.

14:31.313 --> 14:33.013
I toast to you this time.

14:33.013 --> 14:34.180
Our Ding family

14:34.180 --> 14:36.446
will never forget the Zhan family's kindness.

14:36.446 --> 14:38.879
Zhao Lan, you're being too formal.

14:38.879 --> 14:41.586
There's no need for such talk between us.

14:52.013 --> 14:53.879
I'm sorry, Brother Ding.

14:53.879 --> 14:55.680
I really couldn't help myself.

14:55.680 --> 14:57.146
I'm just too hungry.

14:57.146 --> 15:00.118
It's fine. Eat anything you want.

15:08.680 --> 15:09.879
Zhao Lan,

15:09.879 --> 15:12.030
is Yue Hua feeling any better?

15:12.813 --> 15:15.513
Much better. Ying Jie just checked on her.

15:15.513 --> 15:17.559
She's asleep.

15:19.080 --> 15:21.013
She has always been very healthy.

15:21.013 --> 15:22.213
It's rare to see her so ill

15:22.213 --> 15:24.200
that she can't even leave her room.

15:24.200 --> 15:27.046
You know Yue Hua. She's very stubborn.

15:27.046 --> 15:28.946
She started feeling unwell a few days ago,

15:28.946 --> 15:30.260
but she insisted on not seeing a physician.

15:30.260 --> 15:32.746
Now look what happened.
Her treatment was delayed.

15:32.746 --> 15:36.080
That's why it has
become quite serious now.

15:36.080 --> 15:37.146
Brother Ding,

15:37.146 --> 15:38.646
didn't you say earlier

15:38.646 --> 15:41.180
that Lady Ding only started having
a fever and dizziness this morning?

15:41.180 --> 15:43.340
How did it become a "a few days ago"
thing?

15:43.340 --> 15:45.619
Really? I must have misspoken then.

15:45.619 --> 15:47.146
Let's not talk about that.

15:47.146 --> 15:48.146
Here, Zhan.

15:48.146 --> 15:50.346
Your official business is more important.

15:50.346 --> 15:52.040
I'll finish writing the letter tonight.

15:52.040 --> 15:54.120
Chief Lu never shields faults.

15:54.120 --> 15:56.606
And Chief Han was a soldier.

15:56.606 --> 15:59.239
They know
the gravity of stealing an official seal.

15:59.239 --> 16:03.714
Bai Yu Tang will listen to the words
of his elder brothers.

16:06.106 --> 16:08.706
Thank you. Zhao Lan.

16:08.706 --> 16:10.239
You're among family here. No ceremony.

16:10.239 --> 16:12.047
Here.

16:33.473 --> 16:34.873
My Lord.

16:34.873 --> 16:38.906
Do you think there's something
strange about the Ding family?

16:38.906 --> 16:40.106
Smart guy.

16:40.106 --> 16:42.006
What did you notice?

16:42.006 --> 16:44.906
I didn't notice anything wrong
with the Ding family.

16:44.906 --> 16:46.973
But I noticed something wrong with you.

16:46.973 --> 16:49.673
You've been preoccupied since dinner.

16:49.673 --> 16:53.910
You must think there's something strange
about the Ding family.

16:55.373 --> 16:57.406
I feel that

16:57.406 --> 17:00.073
Zhao Lan is hiding something from me.

17:00.073 --> 17:03.306
Every family has secrets
they'd rather keep to themselves.

17:03.306 --> 17:06.606
My Lord, you should just focus
on catching your "rat."

17:06.606 --> 17:10.307
It's fine to worry less about other matters.

17:13.280 --> 17:15.673
Oh no. I ate too much for dinner.

17:15.673 --> 17:18.052
I need to go relieve myself.

17:54.106 --> 17:56.462
My Lord!

18:02.673 --> 18:05.640
- What's wrong?
- My Lord.

18:05.640 --> 18:07.273
This Ding family

18:07.273 --> 18:09.473
is indeed a bit strange.

18:09.473 --> 18:11.239
I stepped out of the privy,

18:11.239 --> 18:13.973
and ran into Ying Jie, whom we saw earlier.

18:13.973 --> 18:16.106
In her basket, paper money and candles.

18:16.106 --> 18:18.600
The sort for the dead.

18:21.206 --> 18:22.773
What illness does Yue Hua have?

18:22.773 --> 18:25.506
It's nothing serious.
Just dizziness and a fever this morning.

18:25.506 --> 18:26.573
She has taken medicine

18:26.573 --> 18:28.746
and is resting in her room now.

18:33.640 --> 18:34.756
My Lord.

18:34.756 --> 18:37.421
My Lord, wait for me! My Lord!

18:56.906 --> 18:58.073
My Lord,

18:58.073 --> 19:00.306
this place is too creepy.

19:00.306 --> 19:02.936
Let's go back to our rooms.

19:13.640 --> 19:15.580
Which way did Ying Jie go?

19:15.580 --> 19:17.497
To the backyard.

19:46.006 --> 19:47.473
My Lord,

19:47.473 --> 19:50.612
can we wait till dawn?

20:00.406 --> 20:02.440
An ice coffin?

20:02.440 --> 20:04.100
Who died?

20:04.100 --> 20:07.206
I didn't see anyone
wearing mourning clothes here.

20:07.206 --> 20:09.573
My Lord, it's too scary here.

20:09.573 --> 20:11.506
Let's go back first.

20:11.506 --> 20:13.525
If you want to know what's strange about here,

20:13.525 --> 20:16.533
why not just ask Ding Zhao Lan directly?

20:23.906 --> 20:26.440
He's intent on hiding it from me.

20:26.440 --> 20:28.373
Even if I ask,

20:28.373 --> 20:30.847
he won't tell me the truth.

20:31.973 --> 20:33.673
If you're scared,

20:33.673 --> 20:34.763
go back up first.

20:34.763 --> 20:36.073
No. No.

20:36.073 --> 20:37.506
The Ding family is truly bizarre.

20:37.506 --> 20:40.410
I'd feel safer staying with you, My Lord.

20:45.640 --> 20:47.039
Hold the light.

20:47.039 --> 20:48.973
My Lord, what are you doing?

20:48.973 --> 20:52.816
The elders say it's bad luck
to open a coffin at night.

20:54.273 --> 20:56.780
Lady Ding, please don't blame us.

20:56.780 --> 20:58.940
We didn't mean to do this.

20:58.940 --> 21:01.046
You're praying to the wrong person.

21:01.046 --> 21:02.906
This isn't Yue Hua.

21:02.906 --> 21:05.306
This is Yue Hua's maid,

21:05.306 --> 21:07.247
Xiao Yun.

21:11.506 --> 21:14.239
So why did Brother Ding say

21:14.239 --> 21:16.634
she went back home for marriage?

21:25.840 --> 21:27.073
That wound...

21:27.073 --> 21:29.437
She did it to herself.

21:37.473 --> 21:39.073
How did Xiao Yun die?

21:39.073 --> 21:41.206
Why is she in an ice coffin?

21:41.206 --> 21:42.873
I went to Yue Hua's room just now.

21:42.873 --> 21:44.873
She wasn't in there at all.

21:44.873 --> 21:47.172
Her table was covered in dust,

21:47.172 --> 21:49.410
as if no one had lived there for a long time.

21:55.973 --> 21:58.239
Zhan.

21:58.239 --> 21:59.706
Regarding Yue Hua,

21:59.706 --> 22:01.906
I did lie to you.

22:01.906 --> 22:03.206
Please, have a seat.

22:03.206 --> 22:04.706
I'll explain everything to you.

22:04.706 --> 22:07.106
Ding Zhao Lan, how did you know

22:07.106 --> 22:08.673
Zhan Zhao would come,

22:08.673 --> 22:11.567
and have the house prepared for him in advance?

22:12.206 --> 22:14.239
Because the person before us

22:14.239 --> 22:16.573
isn't Zhao Lan at all.

22:16.573 --> 22:20.006
It's Zhao Hui. We saw him at the pier.

22:20.006 --> 22:21.473
He used his lightness skill

22:21.473 --> 22:24.609
and got back home before us.

22:31.240 --> 22:34.006
What are you saying?

22:34.006 --> 22:36.206
I am Zhao Lan.

22:36.206 --> 22:38.073
There's a messenger at our gate.

22:38.073 --> 22:39.096
That's why I...

22:39.096 --> 22:40.206
Zhan.

22:40.206 --> 22:44.173
Zhan, listen to me. Zhao Hui went out.
I'll call him back now.

22:44.173 --> 22:45.273
Zhan.

22:45.273 --> 22:47.378
Zhan!

22:51.260 --> 22:53.006
Zhan.

22:53.006 --> 22:54.922
Step aside.

22:58.410 --> 23:00.072
[Ding Zhao Lan, one of the Ding Twins]

23:00.072 --> 23:01.917
Oh, my.

23:18.973 --> 23:22.873
Every time I tried to act as my elder brother,
you always saw through me.

23:22.873 --> 23:24.773
I should have known
that growing up wouldn't change it.

23:24.773 --> 23:27.606
When did you notice?

23:27.606 --> 23:28.640
During dinner.

23:28.640 --> 23:30.673
You stopped me
from asking further about Yue Hua,

23:30.673 --> 23:34.773
but your way of saying
Bai Yu Tang stole the official seal.

23:34.773 --> 23:38.956
I only said it at the pier.

23:40.706 --> 23:41.906
Zhao Hui,

23:41.906 --> 23:44.667
what exactly happened to the Ding family?

23:48.006 --> 23:49.473
My brother...

23:49.473 --> 23:52.380
He's been in a coma
from serious injuries for a year.

23:53.873 --> 23:55.473
A year ago,

23:55.473 --> 23:58.673
Uncle Ding passed away suddenly.

23:58.673 --> 24:00.206
Zhao Hui,

24:00.206 --> 24:01.974
is there something about Uncle Ding's death

24:01.974 --> 24:04.052
that's been kept from us?

24:04.773 --> 24:06.760
Zhan,

24:06.760 --> 24:08.873
nothing can be hidden from you.

24:08.873 --> 24:11.640
The cuts in the bamboo forest
at Tingfeng Pavilion are very clean.

24:11.640 --> 24:13.406
It wasn't from normal trimming,

24:13.406 --> 24:15.973
but rather from a fight.

24:15.973 --> 24:19.573
The new leaf buds have been out for some days.

24:19.573 --> 24:22.106
The fight must have happened

24:22.106 --> 24:24.006
when Uncle Ding passed away.

24:24.006 --> 24:25.806
A year ago,

24:25.806 --> 24:29.239
when you came for my father's funeral,

24:29.239 --> 24:32.168
we lied to you.

24:33.573 --> 24:36.990
My father didn't die of a sudden illness.

24:37.673 --> 24:40.674
He was killed by the Zhanlu Sword.

24:41.373 --> 24:43.273
My father's body

24:43.273 --> 24:47.373
was brought back by the leader
of the Shangqing Sect,

24:47.373 --> 24:49.273
Jing Yi Ming.

24:49.273 --> 24:50.606
Uncle Jing.

24:50.606 --> 24:53.106
Who did this cruel thing to my father?

24:53.106 --> 24:55.006
Our Ding siblings

24:55.006 --> 24:56.640
will make him pay.

24:56.640 --> 24:59.840
[Ding Yue Hua, from the Ding family]
He was there for my birthday.

24:59.840 --> 25:02.039
After staying at my manor for a few days,

25:02.039 --> 25:05.506
[Jing Yi Ming, Head of the Shangqing Sect]
he bid me farewell and set off alone.

25:05.506 --> 25:07.039
No one saw

25:07.039 --> 25:09.073
who he fought with.

25:09.073 --> 25:10.973
By the time I got the news and arrived,

25:10.973 --> 25:14.039
I only saw his body.

25:14.039 --> 25:16.106
I checked his wound.

25:16.106 --> 25:19.039
It was clearly caused by the Zhanlu Sword.

25:19.039 --> 25:20.440
But that sword

25:20.440 --> 25:22.673
is now nowhere to be found.

25:22.673 --> 25:26.706
I'm afraid the villain killed him

25:26.706 --> 25:28.920
just to seize that precious sword.

25:28.920 --> 25:31.773
Few in all the realm

25:31.773 --> 25:35.239
could break Heavenward Crane Strike,

25:35.239 --> 25:38.700
and snatch the Zhanlu Sword from my father.

25:38.700 --> 25:41.039
Even if I have to scour every corner,

25:41.039 --> 25:43.506
I will find this person.

25:43.506 --> 25:45.273
The Ding siblings will make him pay.

25:45.273 --> 25:46.373
Brother Zhao Hui.

25:46.373 --> 25:47.440
I'm going with you.

25:47.440 --> 25:49.073
Enough.

25:49.073 --> 25:50.506
The most important thing now

25:50.506 --> 25:53.749
is to arrange Father's funeral.

25:57.906 --> 25:59.506
Uncle Jing,

25:59.506 --> 26:01.673
thank you for your effort

26:01.673 --> 26:03.239
in escorting my father's body

26:03.239 --> 26:04.773
all the way back.

26:04.773 --> 26:06.273
After the funeral ended,

26:06.273 --> 26:08.440
to express our gratitude to Jing Yi Ming,

26:08.440 --> 26:10.640
we invited him to stay for a few more days,

26:10.640 --> 26:11.440
but never expected...

26:11.440 --> 26:12.506
Lady!

26:12.506 --> 26:14.206
Lady!

26:14.206 --> 26:15.206
Lady.

26:15.206 --> 26:17.499
Look who's back.

26:22.006 --> 26:23.673
Xiao Yun!

26:23.673 --> 26:27.406
Didn't you go home to get married?
How did you end up like this?

26:27.406 --> 26:29.478
Lady.

26:50.206 --> 26:51.273
Jing Yi Ming!

26:51.273 --> 26:52.973
Yue Hua, are you crazy?

26:52.973 --> 26:54.073
What are you doing?

26:54.073 --> 26:55.606
Xiao Yun told me

26:55.606 --> 26:56.873
that Jing Yi Ming raped her,

26:56.873 --> 26:58.900
and threw her into a brothel!

26:58.900 --> 27:00.260
Absurd!

27:00.260 --> 27:02.006
This is nonsense.

27:02.006 --> 27:04.573
I would never do such a despicable thing.

27:04.573 --> 27:05.773
Yue Hua,

27:05.773 --> 27:08.573
is it possible Xiao Yun mistook him?

27:08.573 --> 27:10.506
How could Uncle Jing...

27:10.506 --> 27:13.206
You believe him just because he's a master?

27:13.206 --> 27:14.506
Yue Hua,

27:14.506 --> 27:16.840
don't be rash.

27:16.840 --> 27:19.506
Uncle Jing's Shangqing Sect
is far away in Xiangzhou.

27:19.506 --> 27:21.573
Xiao Yun had always been here

27:21.573 --> 27:23.406
then returned to her hometown.

27:23.406 --> 27:25.073
They shouldn't even know each other.

27:25.073 --> 27:26.473
Don't forget,

27:26.473 --> 27:28.173
the day before Xiao Yun left here,

27:28.173 --> 27:30.120
Jing Yi Ming was here too.

27:30.120 --> 27:33.030
The next day, when she bid father
farewell, Jing Yi Ming was also present.

27:33.030 --> 27:35.773
He intercepted Xiao Yun after she left here.

27:35.773 --> 27:37.173
Utter nonsense!

27:37.173 --> 27:38.506
Where is that girl?

27:38.506 --> 27:39.606
Bring her here.

27:39.606 --> 27:40.806
Let her face me!

27:40.806 --> 27:45.440
Your scandalous deeds are exposed,
yet you still dare to bluster!

27:45.440 --> 27:47.524
Yue Hua!

27:53.340 --> 27:55.060
You don't believe me?

27:55.060 --> 27:56.340
Yue Hua.

27:56.340 --> 27:59.119
Until there is solid evidence,

27:59.119 --> 28:01.575
you must not act rashly.

28:06.906 --> 28:08.973
Lady,

28:08.973 --> 28:10.440
I'm afraid you'll fight him.

28:10.440 --> 28:12.806
Let's... let's go.

28:12.806 --> 28:14.973
Forget it.

28:14.973 --> 28:16.506
Stay right here!

28:16.506 --> 28:19.060
Let her make things clear

28:19.060 --> 28:21.440
before she leaves.

28:21.440 --> 28:22.840
Young lady,

28:22.840 --> 28:24.306
you are young and inexperienced.

28:24.306 --> 28:27.039
Now talking nonsense. I don't blame you.

28:27.039 --> 28:29.206
But the Shangqing Sect
has a century-old reputation.

28:29.206 --> 28:32.239
No one dares to slander it.

28:32.239 --> 28:34.640
My decades of friendship with the Ding family

28:34.640 --> 28:36.660
cannot be ruined too.

28:36.660 --> 28:38.706
Today, before the Ding descendants,

28:38.706 --> 28:39.873
say it once more.

28:39.873 --> 28:41.306
Did I, or did I not,

28:41.306 --> 28:43.373
commit those indecent acts against you?

28:43.373 --> 28:45.673
If not, clear my name.

28:45.673 --> 28:46.773
If I did,

28:46.773 --> 28:48.840
they would never forgive me.

28:48.840 --> 28:52.086
They would surely risk their lives
to seek justice for you.

28:52.086 --> 28:54.373
Tell us.

28:54.373 --> 28:57.039
Did I,

28:57.039 --> 28:59.382
or did I not?

29:02.273 --> 29:04.112
No.

29:04.112 --> 29:06.837
I mistook him for someone else.

29:15.220 --> 29:17.223
Xiao Yun!

29:20.873 --> 29:22.106
Everyone said

29:22.106 --> 29:24.773
Xiao Yun was ashamed to face anyone,
and killed herself

29:24.773 --> 29:26.473
because her virtue was shattered.

29:26.473 --> 29:27.640
But Yue Hua said

29:27.640 --> 29:30.573
Xiao Yun had promised her the night
before that she wouldn't kill herself.

29:30.573 --> 29:33.073
She was certain
Xiao Yun was killed by Jing Yi Ming.

29:33.073 --> 29:35.440
That same day, Jing Yi Ming
went to bid my brother farewell.

29:35.440 --> 29:38.906
He said he didn't want to cause
any more trouble between us.

29:38.906 --> 29:40.040
When Yue Hua heard about it,

29:40.040 --> 29:42.373
she took her sword
and rushed to Tingfeng Pavilion.

29:42.373 --> 29:44.088
Zhao Lan!

29:45.506 --> 29:47.510
Zhao Lan!

29:53.606 --> 29:55.546
It wasn't me.

29:56.806 --> 29:57.973
It wasn't me.

29:57.973 --> 29:59.606
He was fighting with Zhao Lan.

29:59.606 --> 30:01.706
He pushed Zhao Lan onto my sword.
It wasn't me!

30:01.706 --> 30:04.273
How could a family like Ding
ever produce a daughter like you?

30:04.273 --> 30:07.039
You came here with a sword.
Zhao Lan was afraid you would hurt me.

30:07.039 --> 30:08.440
That's why he stepped in.

30:08.440 --> 30:09.673
No matter how angry you are,

30:09.673 --> 30:11.100
you shouldn't have done this to him.

30:11.100 --> 30:13.098
- You...
- Yue Hua!

30:15.106 --> 30:17.209
Stop it!

30:27.773 --> 30:29.473
Yue Hua left after that,

30:29.473 --> 30:31.603
and she never came back.

30:33.173 --> 30:36.440
Actually, my brother's sword wound
wasn't that serious that day.

30:36.440 --> 30:37.873
His physical wounds

30:37.873 --> 30:39.440
have been healing day by day.

30:39.440 --> 30:42.796
But for some reason, he remains unconscious.

30:43.840 --> 30:46.373
To this day, I still don't understand

30:46.373 --> 30:49.473
what really happened that day.

30:49.473 --> 30:51.506
I asked the butler later.

30:51.506 --> 30:54.073
Before Jing Yi Ming bid my brother farewell,

30:54.073 --> 30:56.506
my brother had just checked Xiao Yun's body.

30:56.506 --> 30:58.073
My guess is that

30:58.073 --> 31:00.006
my brother found something suspicious,

31:00.006 --> 31:03.106
so he took a look at Xiao Yun's body.

31:03.106 --> 31:05.610
But I don't think he ever found anything.

31:06.706 --> 31:08.273
If someone slits their own wrist,

31:08.273 --> 31:11.006
the force came from outside in,

31:11.006 --> 31:13.989
and the cut runs deep above, shallow below.

31:14.973 --> 31:16.473
But Xiao Yun's wound

31:16.473 --> 31:17.520
was exactly the opposite.

31:17.520 --> 31:18.660
So,

31:18.660 --> 31:21.706
Xiao Yun was murdered.

31:21.706 --> 31:22.873
Besides,

31:22.873 --> 31:24.873
even if Yue Hua didn't mean it,

31:24.873 --> 31:27.239
she couldn't have damaged Zhao Lan's meridians.

31:27.239 --> 31:30.940
Only severed meridians
would leave him unconscious.

31:30.940 --> 31:35.306
Yue Hua's skill is nowhere near that level.

31:35.306 --> 31:37.840
Unless
Zhao Lan's Heavenward Crane Strike was broken.

31:37.840 --> 31:40.903
The power he gathered never left him
when preparing Heavenward Crane Strike.

31:40.903 --> 31:42.506
Instead, it tore through his body

31:42.506 --> 31:44.180
crashing into his own meridians.

31:44.180 --> 31:45.613
As you said,

31:45.613 --> 31:47.641
before Jing went to bid Zhao Lan farewell,

31:47.641 --> 31:50.706
Zhao Lan had just checked Xiao Yun's body.

31:50.706 --> 31:52.506
Zhao Lan is very thorough.

31:52.506 --> 31:54.239
He must have discovered

31:54.239 --> 31:56.460
that Xiao Yun didn't commit suicide.

31:56.460 --> 31:59.440
Stay back! Stay back!

31:59.440 --> 32:01.573
- Stay back!
- No need to fear.

32:01.573 --> 32:04.773
I'm here to set you free.

32:04.773 --> 32:06.206
If you tell the truth,

32:06.206 --> 32:08.173
not only will you shatter your virtue,

32:08.173 --> 32:10.006
but you'll also drag the Ding family down.

32:10.006 --> 32:11.406
Why bother?

32:11.406 --> 32:13.406
You might as well

32:13.406 --> 32:15.894
leave yourself some dignity.

33:01.640 --> 33:03.612
Zhao Hui.

33:04.220 --> 33:06.634
You've already done very well.

33:07.706 --> 33:09.206
What have I done?

33:09.206 --> 33:12.873
I even helped Jing Yi Ming.

33:12.873 --> 33:15.990
I let him destroy the Ding family

33:16.794 --> 33:19.234
right in front of me.

33:20.340 --> 33:22.840
No one knows the Ding's eldest son is in a coma

33:22.840 --> 33:24.953
from a serious injury.

33:24.953 --> 33:26.153
That's because of you.

33:26.153 --> 33:28.520
You pretend to be Zhao Lan in public,

33:28.520 --> 33:30.186
which is how you fooled everyone.

33:30.186 --> 33:34.353
Everyone covets
our Heavenward Crane Strike and Zhanlu Sword.

33:34.353 --> 33:36.586
The chief of the Ding family has passed.

33:36.586 --> 33:39.253
If word got out that the eldest son
was also in a coma,

33:39.253 --> 33:42.386
the Ding family's situation

33:42.386 --> 33:45.094
would be worse than we imagined.

33:50.850 --> 33:52.580
Before today,

33:52.580 --> 33:54.406
I thought you

33:54.406 --> 33:57.953
were still that reckless and impulsive boy.

33:57.953 --> 33:59.600
I didn't expect that overnight,

33:59.600 --> 34:02.720
you would shoulder the family burden.

34:11.653 --> 34:13.886
No matter what I do now,

34:13.886 --> 34:16.586
I can't make it up to Yue Hua and Xiao Yun.

34:16.586 --> 34:19.240
Since Yue Hua ran away from home,

34:19.240 --> 34:22.040
she hasn't returned once.

34:23.086 --> 34:25.353
She must hate me to death.

34:25.353 --> 34:27.900
I really want to explain to her.

34:27.900 --> 34:30.320
When I blocked her sword that day,

34:30.320 --> 34:34.291
it wasn't because I believed Jing Yi Ming.

34:34.986 --> 34:37.119
She is no match for Jing Yi Ming.

34:37.119 --> 34:39.353
You were afraid she would get hurt.

34:39.353 --> 34:42.186
Don't worry. Once Yue Hua calms down,

34:42.186 --> 34:44.348
she will understand.

34:48.389 --> 34:50.486
Xiao Yun's death was suspicious.

34:50.486 --> 34:51.773
My brother is in a coma,

34:51.773 --> 34:53.420
and Yue Hua is missing.

34:53.420 --> 34:55.880
No one could confront Jing Yi Ming
about what he had done.

34:55.880 --> 34:58.480
I had to store Xiao Yun's body
in an ice coffin.

34:58.480 --> 35:01.913
I wanted to wait until we found Yue Hua
and we could investigate everything.

35:01.913 --> 35:04.146
I wanted to see if we could find

35:04.146 --> 35:05.713
any clues from Xiao Yun's body,

35:05.713 --> 35:09.079
so we could expose it and get her justice.

35:09.079 --> 35:11.079
Today is the anniversary of her death.

35:11.079 --> 35:14.743
I asked her close friend, Ying Jie,
to pay her respects.

35:15.480 --> 35:19.013
I didn't expect you to notice, Zhan.

35:19.013 --> 35:20.113
Zhan,

35:20.113 --> 35:23.046
you've only been here half a day
and you've already seen the truth.

35:23.046 --> 35:25.045
Clearly,

35:26.013 --> 35:28.352
I was too clumsy.

35:34.820 --> 35:36.880
I could see it

35:36.880 --> 35:40.946
because Jing Yi Ming, that grandmaster,
made me suspicious.

35:40.946 --> 35:42.346
In Xiangzhou,

35:42.346 --> 35:45.346
I was ambushed by Zhi Hua the Black Fox.

35:45.346 --> 35:47.346
The moves he used

35:47.346 --> 35:50.013
were the Great Compassion Palm
from the Shangqing Sect.

35:50.013 --> 35:52.880
The Great Compassion Palm is only
passed on to Shangqing Sect disciples.

35:52.880 --> 35:56.429
How did Zhi Hua learn this secret technique?

35:57.613 --> 35:59.280
Is there more

35:59.280 --> 36:02.513
between Zhi Hua and the Shangqing Sect

36:02.513 --> 36:05.690
than we've been told?

36:07.660 --> 36:09.880
About this affair.

36:09.880 --> 36:12.700
About your father's death.

36:12.700 --> 36:15.729
I won't rest until I've uncovered everything.

36:17.880 --> 36:20.018
From the look of it now,

36:20.646 --> 36:23.713
Jing Yi Ming must be the one
who killed my father.

36:23.713 --> 36:27.280
If Jing Yi Ming really can break
Heavenward Crane Strike,

36:27.280 --> 36:28.880
then the murderer

36:28.880 --> 36:30.413
is very likely to be him.

36:30.413 --> 36:34.146
What a so-called grandmaster.

36:34.146 --> 36:36.146
I'm going to storm the Shangqing Sect

36:36.146 --> 36:38.481
and end him with my sword!

36:45.746 --> 36:48.113
Zhan,

36:48.113 --> 36:50.013
I know what you want to say.

36:50.013 --> 36:51.613
Don't worry.

36:51.613 --> 36:54.513
I won't rush into anything.

36:54.513 --> 36:56.346
With my current skills,

36:56.346 --> 37:00.390
seeking revenge on Jing Yi Ming
would be like throwing an egg against a stone.

37:02.679 --> 37:04.480
But one day,

37:04.480 --> 37:06.679
the Ding family will make him

37:06.679 --> 37:09.924
pay for it in blood.

37:18.946 --> 37:20.246
Zhao Hui,

37:20.246 --> 37:22.713
there is something I'm curious about.

37:22.713 --> 37:24.813
Chief Lu and the other three

37:24.813 --> 37:26.713
are of similar age and share the same ideals,

37:26.713 --> 37:28.113
which is why they became sworn brothers.

37:28.113 --> 37:29.546
But why did Bai Yu Tang,

37:29.546 --> 37:31.313
at such a young age, join them?

37:31.313 --> 37:35.313
I heard it's because Bai Yu Tang
helped Chief Lu avenge his father's death.

37:35.313 --> 37:37.480
Chief Lu's father

37:37.480 --> 37:40.213
was generous and charitable.
But his wealth became known,

37:40.213 --> 37:42.446
and a band of outlaws robbed and killed him.

37:42.446 --> 37:44.346
The authorities failed to find them for days,

37:44.346 --> 37:45.900
but Bai Yu Tang used a clever scheme

37:45.900 --> 37:47.713
to lure them into a trap.

37:47.713 --> 37:50.713
Only then was Chief Lu
able to hand the bandits over to the law.

37:50.713 --> 37:53.790
Thus, the two became sworn brothers.

37:56.013 --> 37:58.313
From childhood, Bai Yu Tang was skilled,

37:58.313 --> 37:59.679
chivalrous, and righteous.

37:59.679 --> 38:01.719
Truly remarkable.

38:04.546 --> 38:06.380
We're almost there.

38:30.846 --> 38:33.513
Ming Zhu Er, stay here.

38:33.513 --> 38:34.679
Lord Zhan.

38:34.679 --> 38:36.079
Leave Ming Zhu Er with me.

38:36.079 --> 38:37.146
Don't worry.

38:37.146 --> 38:39.946
My Lord, old Ding and I won't go anywhere.

38:39.946 --> 38:41.013
Don't worry.

38:41.013 --> 38:43.770
You two must also be careful.

39:01.413 --> 39:02.446
Madam!

39:02.446 --> 39:03.813
Zhen Er!

39:03.813 --> 39:05.079
- Did you find them?
- No.

39:05.079 --> 39:06.380
Where did everyone go?

39:06.380 --> 39:09.100
Madam must have seen Number Five​ going crazy
and taken everyone into hiding.

39:09.100 --> 39:11.213
[Lu Fang, Zuantian Rat][Han Zhang, Chedi Rat]
Let's keep looking.

39:11.213 --> 39:13.813
- Brother Lu, Brother Han!
- Zhao Hui, why did you come here?

39:13.813 --> 39:16.313
Go now! Don't throw your life away!

39:16.313 --> 39:19.613
Chief Lu, I'm Zhan Zhao of Kaifeng Prefecture.
What has happened on the island?

39:19.613 --> 39:20.913
Zhan Zhao?

39:20.913 --> 39:22.313
Even you came?

39:22.313 --> 39:23.363
Lord Bao's official seal

39:23.363 --> 39:24.820
was stolen by Bai Yu Tang.

39:24.820 --> 39:28.646
I'm here to persuade him to return it.

39:28.646 --> 39:30.313
Number Five must have lost his mind.

39:30.313 --> 39:31.920
He ignored the Chief's advice.

39:31.920 --> 39:34.260
Went to the capital
just to fight the Imperial Cat.

39:34.260 --> 39:39.246
Now brought the authorities here,
and caused such trouble on Xiankong Island.

39:39.246 --> 39:41.846
Bai Yu Tang really killed those people outside?

39:41.846 --> 39:44.313
- I...
- Bai Yu Tang won't kill the innocent.

39:44.313 --> 39:46.946
Could there be some misunderstanding?

39:46.946 --> 39:49.046
Zhan Zhao,

39:49.046 --> 39:51.430
you are finally here.

40:22.113 --> 40:24.480
Brothers, Zhan Zhao wants to kill me!

40:24.480 --> 40:28.146
You can't watch me die right in front of you.

40:34.846 --> 40:36.046
Brothers,

40:36.046 --> 40:38.313
you just said Bai Yu Tang was absurd.

40:38.313 --> 40:40.368
Why are you listening to him now?

40:40.946 --> 40:43.079
If anyone got mad, it was those two.

40:43.079 --> 40:44.880
Not Bai Yu Tang.

40:44.880 --> 40:47.346
They seem to have been poisoned.

41:58.213 --> 42:00.160
Don't move.

42:08.513 --> 42:10.846
You've stepped on a fire mine.

42:10.846 --> 42:13.046
Han Zhang has a military background.

42:13.046 --> 42:14.079
While in the army,

42:14.079 --> 42:16.470
he became an expert in gunpowder.

42:17.546 --> 42:18.620
What are you waiting for?

42:18.620 --> 42:20.856
Kill them!

42:33.411 --> 42:34.880
You! Help him.

42:34.880 --> 42:37.560
Make sure to kill them both.

42:46.920 --> 42:48.923
[Jiang Ping, Fanjiang Rat]
[Xu Qing, Chuanshan Rat]

42:50.546 --> 42:52.376
Big Brother!
